<div class="Section1">

<h1>Marshal Wahl</h1>
<p class="eyebrow">Web Developer &amp; Software Engineering Student</p>
<p class="contact">
  <span>Boise, Idaho</span>&middot;
  <span><a href="mailto:marshalwahl85@gmail.com">marshalwahl85@gmail.com</a></span>&middot;
  <span><a href="https://github.com/mwahl1">github.com/mwahl1</a></span>&middot;
  <span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marshalwahl">linkedin.com/in/marshalwahl</a></span>
</p>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<p>Web developer and software engineering student who ships end to end: schema and API through to deployed interface. Experience delivering live client sites, internal business tools, and shipped game builds.</p>

<h2>Selected Experience</h2>
<h3>Freelance Web Developer</h3>
<p>Built and launched client sites including a live medical credentialing business site — build, Netlify deploy with GitHub auto-deploy, custom domain DNS, and SSL. Delivered a full brand system (logo suite, palette, wordmark) for a billing LLC and coordinated developer access for a collaborator extending the site with a provider portal.</p>
<h3>Independent Projects</h3>
<p>Designed and built Proviso, a provider-tracking web app on React/Vite/Tailwind/Supabase with row-level security. Built a Flask billing automation portal (SQLAlchemy, Pandas, SQLite). Shipped Unity game builds including a procedurally generated golf sim and a collectible-card basketball game backed by Supabase.</p>

<h2>Education</h2>
<h3>College of Western Idaho</h3>
<p class="edu-note">A.A.S. in Software Development — in progress, sophomore year</p>
<p>Coursework in intermediate web application development, Git workflows (branching, merging, rebasing, remotes), and math/statistics including financial mathematics.</p>
<h3>Boise State University</h3>
<p class="edu-note">Bachelor's degree, Information Technology Management — planned, following CWI</p>

<h2>Skills</h2>
<div class="skills">
  <p><b>Languages:</b> JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, C#, Java, SQL, HTML/CSS</p>
  <p><b>Front end:</b> React, Vite, Tailwind, Bootstrap 5, jQuery</p>
  <p><b>Back end &amp; data:</b> Flask, SQLAlchemy, Supabase, PostgreSQL/RLS, SQLite, Pandas</p>
  <p><b>Apps &amp; games:</b> Unity 6, Jetpack Compose, Android, Node.js</p>
  <p><b>Tooling:</b> Git, GitHub, Netlify, Vercel, DNS/SSL</p>
</div>

</div>
